      "data": {
        "text": "**Developing Translation Function**\n\nI've successfully crafted the `translate_dictionary_values.py` module. It leverages the Google Cloud Translation API for the core translation function. I incorporated the `google.cloud.translate_v2` import and established a `translate.Client()` to identify the provider. An example usage scenario is included within the `if __name__ == '__main__':` block.\n\n\n**Confirming Module Completion**\n\nI've finalized the `translate_dictionary_values.py` module. It's built around the Google Cloud Translation API using the `google.cloud.translate_v2` library and a `translate.Client()` for provider identification, exactly as requested. I've also added an example usage in the `if __name__ == '__main__':` section. The task is complete.\n\n\n",
